    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Zero Pixel Dawn</i>, you're dropped into a chaotic, post-apocalyptic pixelated world where magic meets humans. Explore deadly biomes with mutated creatures, and arcane anomalies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You begin with nothing but basic gear. As you scavenge, upgrade, and survive, you'll uncover fragments of a forgotten world\u2014mysterious books, and experimental weapons. Between runs, return to your hideout to upgrade your spells or craft deadly tools with questionable vendors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797770/extras/43ccd18222d861e40cbe5678fd4ddd9f.poster.avif?t=1751768966\" width=800 height=532 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797770/extras/43ccd18222d861e40cbe5678fd4ddd9f.webm?t=1751768966\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797770/extras/43ccd18222d861e40cbe5678fd4ddd9f.mp4?t=1751768966\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Zero Pixel Dawn</i>, you're dropped into a chaotic, post-apocalyptic pixelated world where magic meets humans. Explore deadly biomes with mutated creatures, and arcane anomalies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You begin with nothing but basic gear. As you scavenge, upgrade, and survive, you'll uncover fragments of a forgotten world\u2014mysterious books, and experimental weapons. Between runs, return to your hideout to upgrade your spells or craft deadly tools with questionable vendors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797770/extras/43ccd18222d861e40cbe5678fd4ddd9f.poster.avif?t=1751768966\" width=800 height=532 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797770/extras/43ccd18222d861e40cbe5678fd4ddd9f.webm?t=1751768966\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797770/extras/43ccd18222d861e40cbe5678fd4ddd9f.mp4?t=1751768966\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
